s_01","es_02"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":1},"gap_items":[],"heading":"入选标准","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"符合以下全部条件的受试者方可入组本研究：（1）年龄18至75周岁（含），性别不限；（2）经超声心动图（ECHO）评估左室射血分数（LVEF）≤40%，且纽约心脏协会（NYHA）心功能分级为II级或III级；（3）筛选前已接受稳定剂量指南推荐药物治疗（GDMT）至少4周，仍存在心力衰竭相关症状。上述三项条件须同时满足，缺一不可。","rationale":"三项入选标准直接来源于项目研究定义中已确认的入选标准模块及研究人群概述，与章节包当前正文一致。医学经理需确认：GDMT具体涵盖的药物类别是否需在正文中逐一列举；'稳定剂量'的判定标准（如剂量不变天数）是否需补充定义；ECHO评估的质控要求是否需在本章或方法学章节另行说明。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（入选标准）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_9e58cf742ce8_355d1bf230e95539","section_number":"5.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:63200f3a68a927a8e61bb209","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0eebb4939327b8"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006035727_cb2d1600","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"由医学经理提供或确认本项目筛选失败定义、筛选期重复检查允许范围、重新筛选条件及编号规则","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_55_01","missing_source_classes":["项目专属筛选失败与重新筛选实施规则文件"],"target":"5.5节全文"}],"heading":"筛选失败与重新筛选","missing_source_classes":["项目专属筛选失败与重新筛选实施规则文件","筛选期重复检查与重新筛选的操作规程"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"本章节需要项目专属的筛选失败定义、重新筛选条件、重新筛选编号规则及筛选期重复检查的允许范围等实施规则。公司语料中虽存在筛选失败与重新筛选的参考文本（含重复检查1次、重新筛选1次、新筛选编号等要素），但该文本来源于其他项目方案，仅可作为章节结构与措辞参照，不可直接继承为本项目已确认规则。当前项目研究定义中未包含筛选失败与重新筛选的专属条款。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_9e58cf742ce8_ffd363f8c6574015","section_number":"5.5","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:63200f3a68a927a8e61bb209","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0eebb4939327b8"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006035727_cb2d1600","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:revision:6","quote":"试验干预：KZ-sGC501片剂每日一次口服，低/中/高三个剂量水平，双盲双模拟，治疗期12周，联合标准GDMT背景治疗。","quote_sha256":"cb6f0c92e4da9bf91b5c456e1efa453e5042cdc767cf7a4621b2623993ed4d81","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","span_id":"es_04"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:revision:6","quote":"剂量与给药方案：SMOKE-r5-1W口服sGC刺激剂（KZ-sGC501）：低剂量2.5 mg qd、中剂量5 mg qd、高剂量10 mg qd，每日晨起随餐口服；每4周随访评估耐受性，按方案规定剂量调整。","quote_sha256":"07951cbf09173c096a3cbf08358925f2060fd4acdec031abd8538c9618ca6296","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","span_id":"es_05"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:revision:6","quote":"安慰剂：安慰剂平行对照：外观与气味与试验药一致的模拟片，每日一次，给药与访视安排同试验组，联合相同GDMT背景，按1:1:1:1随机分配。","quote_sha256":"f1f6aff7a4ebd367dd14c0174b7a455eac32886b24c3d7578ef76ccbfce93fc4","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","span_id":"es_06"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_04","es_05","es_06"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":3},"gap_items":[{"action":"由医学经理确认剂量调整触发条件、暂停与恢复流程及永久停药标准","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_6_01","missing_source_classes":["剂量调整/暂停/恢复/永久停药操作细则"],"target":"6节剂量调整与停药规则"},{"action":"确认各剂量组模拟片规格、数量及匹配方式","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_6_02","missing_source_classes":["双盲双模拟各剂量组模拟片规格与数量"],"target":"6节双盲双模拟实施细节"}],"heading":"研究治疗/干预","missing_source_classes":["剂量调整/暂停/恢复/永久停药操作细则","双盲双模拟各剂量组模拟片规格与数量"],"proposal_text":"本研究为随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心II期临床研究，旨在对SMOKE-r5-1W口服sGC刺激剂（KZ-sGC501）进行概念验证与剂量探索。受试者按1:1:1:1比例随机分配至KZ-sGC501低剂量组（2.5 mg每日一次）、中剂量组（5 mg每日一次）、高剂量组（10 mg每日一次）或安慰剂组。各组均联合标准GDMT背景治疗。试验药与安慰剂均采用双盲双模拟设计，安慰剂为外观与气味与试验药一致的模拟片，每日一次给药，给药与访视安排同试验组。所有药物均于每日晨起随餐口服。双盲治疗期共12周，自第0天随机给药起至第12周治疗结束访视（第12周±3天）止。每4周随访评估耐受性，剂量调整按方案规定执行。","rationale":"干预设计、三剂量水平、双盲双模拟、1:1:1:1随机分配、12周治疗期、晨起随餐口服、联合GDMT背景及每4周耐受性评估均来源于项目研究定义中已确认的试验干预与剂量给药方案。医学经理需确认：剂量调整的具体触发条件（如血压阈值、症状恶化标准）、暂停与恢复规则、永久停药标准是否需在本章或独立子章节详述；双盲双模拟中各剂量组模拟片的具体规格与数量是否需在本章列明。","review_advisories":["本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_9e58cf742ce8_fa75c962a1c00450","section_number":"6","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:63200f3a68a927a8e61bb209","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0eebb4939327b8"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006035727_cb2d1600","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_9e58cf742ce8_83e9420f4f9f88b3:full-draft:63200f3a68a927a8e61bb209","quote":"SMOKE-r5-1W口服sGC刺激剂（KZ-sGC501）","quote_sha256":"fac8bdc8448fd6ea7ded1c1df2c687a570cd2a75da623025cf6aa9768165d6e5","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:63200f3a68a927a8e61bb209","span_id":"es_07"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:revision:6","quote":"药物技术类型：small_molecule\n给药途径：口服\n剂型：口服固体制剂\n局部/系统暴露范围：systemic","quote_sha256":"93d70823288385813f38b773b8c6e7bba227a7ed893796844d8834e9f3bae884","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","span_id":"es_08"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_07","es_08"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":1},"gap_items":[{"action":"由药学或制剂部门提供各规格片剂外观、辅料、包装形式、储存条件及有效期","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_61_01","missing_source_classes":["试验药各规格片剂外观与辅料组成","包装储存与发放回收操作规程"],"target":"6.1节试验药规格与包装"},{"action":"确认安慰剂模拟片组成及与试验药的外观气味匹配验证方式","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_61_02","missing_source_classes":["安慰剂模拟片匹配验证资料"],"target":"6.1节安慰剂匹配"}],"heading":"试验用药品","missing_source_classes":["试验药各规格片剂外观与辅料组成","包装储存与发放回收操作规程","安慰剂模拟片匹配验证资料"],"proposal_text":"本研究试验用药品为SMOKE-r5-1W口服sGC刺激剂（KZ-sGC501），属小分子化合物，给药途径为口服，剂型为口服固体制剂（片剂），系统暴露。试验药设低剂量2.5 mg、中剂量5 mg、高剂量10 mg三个规格，每日晨起随餐口服一次。安慰剂为外观与气味与试验药一致的模拟片，每日一次口服，给药与访视安排同试验组。","rationale":"药品名称、技术类型（small_molecule）、给药途径（口服）、剂型（口服固体制剂）、系统暴露范围及三个剂量规格均来源于项目研究定义中已确认的药物属性与剂量方案。医学经理需确认：各规格片剂的具体外观描述（颜色、形状、刻痕）、单片含药量与辅料组成、包装形式（铝塑泡罩或瓶装）、储存温度与湿度条件、有效期、运输条件、回收与销毁流程是否需在本章或独立子章节列明；安慰剂模拟片是否含活性辅料及其与试验药的匹配验证方式。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_9e58cf742ce8_9bb436adfc92a8ce","section_number":"6.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:63200f3a68a927a8e61bb209","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0eebb4939327b8"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"994fa8a58b2f83c8fe6d09a22d1617b62723a95f38e7b0602ab4a9d8f99de419","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_9e58cf742ce8_83e9420f4f9f88b3:full-draft:63200f3a68a927a8e61bb209","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:63200f3a68a927a8e61bb209","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:9f14082f8ca9ba3e77613e4c62ca77cff3c65d122f60d56d8ea6c8a1ffab8aa1:63200f3a68a927a8e61bb209","text_sha256":"994fa8a58b2f83c8fe6d09a22d1617b62723a95f38e7b0602ab4a9d8f99de419"},{"content_sha256":"d637529e44577d7b1429b2af86b4b1a8f52590a8b92f2e1d83a773ee335fc31d","locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:revision:6","role":"confirmed_project_facts","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","source_version":"mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","text_sha256":"d637529e44577d7b1429b2af86b4b1a8f52590a8b92f2e1d83a773ee335fc31d"},{"content_sha256":"abe327b691816a29b09e2ea049d5e7c9